#
# Compatibility notes (verified 2026-10-25):
# - Django 5.2 is the current LTS (security support until April 2028).
# - django-prometheus 2.5 supports Django <6.1, which rules out Django 6.1.
# - djangorestframework 3.18 and django-filter 26.x require Django >=5.2.
# - kombu 5.6 (Celery's transport layer) requires redis-py <6.5, so redis-py stays on 6.4.

